                    "name": "Matus Valo"
                },
                "message": "CI: Compare changed file counts numerically in file-changes job\n\nStep outputs are strings, so '<' compared the file counts lexicographically.\nE.g. 2 negative files out of 11 evaluated '2' < '11' as false and skipped\nthe whole test matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
